    "description": {
      "content": "The Power BI REST API provides service endpoints for embedding, administration, governance, and user resources. It enables programmatic access to Power BI content including datasets, reports, dashboards, and workspaces (groups). The API uses Azure Active Directory (OAuth 2.0) for authentication and authorization.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Power BI Support",
